{"seq":2,"slug":"aim-tuning","title":"参数调校","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/practice/aim-tuning","wordCount":2132,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"参数调校\">参数调校</h1><p>到这里，所有旋钮都已认全：减速强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、磁吸系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>、内外半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{in}/\\theta_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、目标获取权重、子弹偏折角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、门控 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>。问题是——这些数字具体该设成多少？<a href=\"../foundations/perceptibility\">可察觉性与手感</a> 已经论证过「黄金区间因人、因距离、因帧率而异」，这意味着靠设计师拍脑袋定一个值几乎必错。参数调校（aim tuning）就是用遥测数据把这些旋钮从「凭感觉」变成「凭证据」的工程闭环：定义能测量辅助好坏的指标，采集分人群、分场景的数据，再把参数一小步一小步地推向数据指示的方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>参数调校（aim tuning）是用遥测数据把辅助旋钮从「凭感觉」变成「凭证据」的工程闭环，因为黄金区间因人、因距离、因帧率而异，拍脑袋定值几乎必错。它围绕三个概念展开。<strong>多目标指标</strong>：命中率、追踪保持时间、新手留存、输入胜负差四类必须同时盯，且互相拉扯——没有哪个可以单独最大化，本质是一个受约束问题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>留存 s.t. </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>胜率差</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 追踪保持</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{s,m,\\theta,\\phi}\\text{留存}\\ \\text{s.t.}\\ |\\text{胜率差}|&lt;\\epsilon,\\ \\text{追踪保持}&lt;\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">留存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">胜率差</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">追踪保持</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>分桶采集</strong>：按技术水平与交战场景切片，否则相反需求会被平均成骗人的中间值。<strong>实验闭环</strong>：把参数调整当作假设，小步灰度 + AB 实验验证后放量，定向、小步、可回退。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>关键纪律</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多目标指标</td>\n<td>四类指标互相拉扯</td>\n<td>不能单独最大化任一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分桶采集</td>\n<td>按人群/场景切片</td>\n<td>聚合成总会说谎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验闭环</td>\n<td>假设 → 灰度 → 验证 → 放量</td>\n<td>定向、小步、可回退</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"先定指标-辅助的好坏怎么量\">先定指标：辅助的好坏怎么量</h2><p>调参的前提是有一把尺子。瞄准辅助要同时服务可玩性、留存、可达性，任何单一指标都会把它带偏。至少要同时盯四类，且它们之间存在张力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>上调辅助的方向</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>命中率</td>\n<td>命中弹数 / 开火弹数</td>\n<td>上升</td>\n<td>只看它会无脑加辅助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追踪保持时间</td>\n<td>准星压在目标上的连续时长</td>\n<td>上升</td>\n<td>过高说明磁吸在替玩家追</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新手留存</td>\n<td>新玩家次日/7 日回归率</td>\n<td>上升（辅助帮新手命中）</td>\n<td>与竞技公平冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入胜负差</td>\n<td>手柄 vs 鼠标的对局胜率差</td>\n<td>应趋近于零</td>\n<td>过大说明补偿失衡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于<strong>没有哪个指标可以单独最大化</strong>。命中率越高越好？那把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 拉满、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 开到最大即可，但输入胜负差会爆炸、竞技完整性崩坏。所以调参永远是一个多目标问题：在「新手命中率够高以保留存」和「输入胜负差够小以保公平」这两个互相拉扯的约束之间，找一组让四类指标都落在可接受带内的参数。可以粗略写成一个受约束的目标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow></munder><mtext> 留存</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t. </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>胜率差</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  追踪保持</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{s,m,\\theta,\\phi}\\ \\text{留存}\\quad \\text{s.t.}\\ |\\text{胜率差}| &lt; \\epsilon,\\ \\ \\text{追踪保持} &lt; \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6382em;vertical-align:-0.8882em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">留存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">胜率差</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">追踪保持</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"分人群-分场景采集\">分人群、分场景采集</h2><p>单一全局指标会把不同人群的相反需求平均成一个骗人的中间值——新手嫌弱、高手嫌强，平均下来「刚好」，实则谁都不满意。所以采集必须切片。至少按两个维度分桶：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>按技术水平</strong>：新手、中段、高段、职业。同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 对新手是救命、对职业是抢枪，四档的最优值可能完全不同。</li>\n<li><strong>按交战场景</strong>：近距离缠斗 vs 远程定点、静止目标 vs 高速横移。<a href=\"../balance/input-fairness\">输入公平</a> 讲过手柄优势随距离翻转，所以近战和远程的辅助表现必须分开看，否则近战的过强会被远程的偏弱掩盖成「总体正常」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套「事件采集 → 分桶 → 指标聚合」的管线，本质是把瞄准辅助接进游戏已有的 <a href=\"../../game-development/game-telemetry-analytics/foundations/telemetry-pipeline\">遥测分析</a> 体系：开火、命中、准星-目标夹角序列、当前输入设备、段位都作为事件上报，在离线侧按人群与场景切片聚合。没有这层数据，调参就退回到「几个策划在内网对枪拍脑袋」，必然过拟合到策划自己的手感。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[对局中埋点&lt;br/&gt;开火 命中 夹角序列 设备 段位] --&gt; B[遥测管线上报]&#10;    B --&gt; C[按技术水平分桶]&#10;    B --&gt; D[按交战场景分桶]&#10;    C --&gt; E[聚合四类指标]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{指标落在带内?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[提出参数调整假设]&#10;    G --&gt; H[灰度/AB 实验]&#10;    H --&gt; B&#10;    F --&gt;|是| I[固化为版本参数]\">flowchart TD\n    A[对局中埋点&lt;br/&gt;开火 命中 夹角序列 设备 段位] --&gt; B[遥测管线上报]\n    B --&gt; C[按技术水平分桶]\n    B --&gt; D[按交战场景分桶]\n    C --&gt; E[聚合四类指标]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{指标落在带内?}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[提出参数调整假设]\n    G --&gt; H[灰度/AB 实验]\n    H --&gt; B\n    F --&gt;|是| I[固化为版本参数]</pre><h2 id=\"用实验闭环-别一把梭\">用实验闭环，别一把梭</h2><p>有了指标和数据，最后一步是怎么改。绝不能直接把新参数推给全服——辅助手感是玩家肌肉记忆的一部分，一次大改会让所有人瞬间「不会瞄了」，引发比数据改善更大的反弹。正确做法是小步灰度：把参数调整当成一次假设（「把 PC 手柄 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span> 会让输入胜负差缩小而不显著伤害留存」），先在一小部分玩家或独立实验组里跑 <a href=\"../../game-development/game-telemetry-analytics/applied/ab-testing-liveops\">AB 实验</a>，比对实验组与对照组的四类指标，确认收益真实、副作用可控，再逐步放量。</p>\n<p>Apex 在 Season 21 把 PC 手柄旋转磁吸从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span>，正是这类基于数据的定向调整——不是全局砍辅助，而是精确地只动一个人群（PC 手柄）的一个旋钮（旋转磁吸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>），保留减速区不变。Black Ops 7 把 jitter 相关的最小档惩罚从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span></span></span></span></span> 回调到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>，也是同一种闭环：先按假设收紧，用数据发现伤到了正常玩家手感，再回调半步。这两个例子共同的方法论是：<strong>定向、小步、可回退</strong>——一次只动一个旋钮、只对一个人群、留好退路。这与 <a href=\"../balance/competitive-integrity\">竞技完整性</a> 里「收紧门控会误伤正常手感」是同一枚硬币：正因为每个旋钮都牵动多方，才更要用实验而非直觉来推它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个常见的统计陷阱-聚合会说谎\">一个常见的统计陷阱：聚合会说谎</h2><p>调参最隐蔽的坑不在采集也不在实验，而在解读聚合数据时的辛普森悖论（Simpson&#39;s paradox）。设想把 PC 手柄的旋转磁吸从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span> 后，看「全体手柄玩家命中率」这个总量，发现它几乎没变，于是得出「这次改动无效」的结论。但把玩家按段位拆开看，可能是：低段位命中率略升（他们本就吃不满 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>，降档影响小），高段位命中率明显降（他们正是靠强磁吸吃统计优势的人群），两者在总量上恰好抵消。总量的「无变化」掩盖了各人群的相反变化。</p>\n<p>这就是为什么前面反复强调「分桶采集」不是可选项而是前提：任何只看聚合总量的调参结论都可能被辛普森悖论反转。安全的读数纪律是——先分桶看每个人群的方向，再看总量；当分桶方向不一致时，总量本身没有意义。这条纪律对 <a href=\"../balance/input-fairness\">输入公平</a> 里「优势随段位翻转」的曲线尤其致命：正因为手柄优势在低段与顶端指向相反，任何跨段位的聚合都会把这条曲线压平成一条骗人的直线。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>聚合命中率</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>命中率</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>各 </mtext><msub><mtext>命中率</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> 的变化方向可能相反</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{聚合命中率} = \\sum_i \\frac{n_i}{N}\\,\\text{命中率}_i\\quad(\\text{各}\\ \\text{命中率}_i\\ \\text{的变化方向可能相反})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">聚合命中率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3852em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">命中率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">各</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">命中率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的变化方向可能相反</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>换句话说，调参的数据素养核心不是「会算平均」，而是「知道什么时候不该信平均」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调参前先立尺子：命中率、追踪保持时间、新手留存、输入胜负差四类指标同时盯，且互相拉扯，是受约束的多目标问题，不能单独最大化任一个。</li>\n<li>采集必须分人群（新手到职业）、分场景（近战/远程、静止/横移）切片，否则相反需求被平均成骗人的中间值。</li>\n<li>把瞄准事件接进游戏遥测管线（开火/命中/夹角序列/设备/段位），在离线侧分桶聚合，替代「策划内网对枪」的过拟合。</li>\n<li>用小步灰度 + AB 实验闭环推参数，定向、小步、可回退（Apex 只降 PC 手柄 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>、BO7 惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\%\\to25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span> 回调），绝不全服一把梭。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>调的这些旋钮的定义：<a href=\"../techniques/magnetism-friction\">磁吸与减速区</a></li>\n<li>指标背后的黄金区间理论：<a href=\"../foundations/perceptibility\">可察觉性与手感</a></li>\n<li>调参与竞技完整性的同源张力：<a href=\"../balance/competitive-integrity\">竞技完整性</a></li>\n<li>埋点与上报的管线：<a href=\"../../game-development/game-telemetry-analytics/foundations/telemetry-pipeline\">遥测分析 · 遥测管线</a></li>\n<li>灰度验证的实验方法：<a href=\"../../game-development/game-telemetry-analytics/applied/ab-testing-liveops\">遥测分析 · AB 实验与 LiveOps</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"参数调校","id":"参数调校"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"先定指标：辅助的好坏怎么量","id":"先定指标-辅助的好坏怎么量"},{"level":2,"text":"分人群、分场景采集","id":"分人群-分场景采集"},{"level":2,"text":"用实验闭环，别一把梭","id":"用实验闭环-别一把梭"},{"level":2,"text":"一个常见的统计陷阱：聚合会说谎","id":"一个常见的统计陷阱-聚合会说谎"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"可达性瞄准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/practice/accessibility-aim"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/practice/aim-assist-in-practice"}}